  "status": "frozen-before-implementation",
  "frozen_at": "2026-08-28T00:00:00Z",
  "question": "Can one automatic, cumulative drawing-to-building pipeline transfer from the accepted sd0401 seed across the other 19 buildings in the frozen HABS corpus?",
